WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.762
Step six reads the plan.

2
00:00:01.762 --> 00:00:04.550
Nine actions, and these
are the four writes.

3
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.713
Set retrievers for gmsa web.

4
00:00:06.713 --> 00:00:09.876
Create a G M S A for the managed service

5
00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:13.651
account msa print oh one,
and for svc intranet.

6
00:00:13.651 --> 00:00:17.348
And complete the D M S A
migration for svc h r sync,

7
00:00:17.348 --> 00:00:23.037
whose migration started forty days
ago, past the thirty-day parallel run.

8
00:00:23.037 --> 00:00:29.188
gmsa ops, gmsa web and svc webfront stay
on the island, as Chapter 3 decided.

9
00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:32.826
The other actions are recorded with
their reasons and write nothing.

10
00:00:32.826 --> 00:00:36.550
Step seven reads the island
list and the reconciliation.

11
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:40.625
Six island rows, each under the
name the account will end up with

12
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:44.700
and with its disposition, four of
them ready for P four point six.

13
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:49.294
gmsa intranet has no S P N owner
and ends at the end of 2028,

14
00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:54.688
so it isn't ready, and its
reconciliation outcome is unreconciled.

15
00:00:54.688 --> 00:00:59.807
svc webfront carries the authorizing
official's acceptance from Chapter 3,

16
00:00:59.807 --> 00:01:02.710
so it becomes ready once
it has an S P N owner.
